label-hidden field__item\"><h1>Paychex Flex Time Off Management: Simplify Time Off Tracking and Requests</h1></div> <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><p><a href=\"https://www.paychex.com/time-attendance\">Paychex Flex Time Off Management</a> helps simplify employee time off management with easy-to-use PTO tracking software, managing PTO balances, and approving requests. This video shows how employees can view real-time time off balances, submit time off requests, and get instant PTO notifications through Paychex Flex®. Managers benefit from a streamlined PTO approval workflow and absence management visibility into employee availability. With calendar integration, automated notifications, and optional integration, this request management solution reduces administrative work and helps to improve the employee experience.</p></div> </div> <div data-datalayer-component-name=\"wysiwyg\" data-datalayer-type=\"wysiwyg\" class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--wysiwyg paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph--class-video-topics\"> <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-compound-heading field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><h2>Topics:</h2></div> <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><ul><li>0:00 – Time Off Management Overview</li><li>0:20 – Employee Time Off Requests</li><li>0:34 – Approval Notifications and Calendar Integration</li></ul></div> </div> <div data-datalayer-component-name=\"wysiwyg\" data-datalayer-type=\"wysiwyg\" class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--wysiwyg paragraph--view-mode--default paragraph--class-video-transcript\"> <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-compound-heading field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>&lt;p id=\"transcript-button\"&gt;View Transcript&lt;/p&gt;</p></div> <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><p><strong>Time Off Management Overview</strong></p><p>0:01 Our newly developed Time Off Management is a unique offering for any business requiring a cohesive system for time off tracking. Time Off Management can now be set up as a standalone feature with Paychex Flex, or in combination with our full featured time and attendance solution, Paychex Flex Time.</p><p><strong>Employee Time Off Requests</strong></p><p>0:22 Our powerful solution helps by providing employees a clear, real-time view of time off balances in Paychex Flex, plus the option to electronically request time off with routing to a manager for approval.</p><p><strong>Approval Notifications and Calendar Integration</strong></p><p>0:36 Once approved, employees can be automatically notified and even integrate time off with their own personal calendars. This is yet another way Paychex makes it simple to engage employees while streamlining your processes.</p></div> </div> <div data-datalayer-component-name=\"cta-full\" data-datalayer-type=\"cta-full\" class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--cta-full paragraph--view-mode--default\"> <div class=\"fullwidth-image-cta columns is-gapless\" data-pg-number=\"\"> <div class=\"column is-two-thirds\"> <div class=\"fullwidth-image-cta-content\"> <div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-article-cta-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"> <div class=\"field field--name-field-compound-heading field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><h2>Simplify Employee Time Off Tracking</h2><p>Manage employee time off requests, PTO balances, approval workflows, and calendar integration from one connected platform. Paychex Flex Time Off Management helps businesses save time while providing employees with a better leave time off management experience.</p></div> <div class=\"field field--name-field-p-link field--type-entity-re